{"skill":"ornn_q","text":{"keyName":{"sourceKey":"Spell_OrnnQ_Name","text":"火山突堑"},"keySummary":{"sourceKey":"Spell_OrnnQ_Summary","text":"奥恩猛砸地面，形成一道裂隙来伤害并减速被击中的敌人们。在一阵短暂的延迟后，一个熔岩之柱会在裂隙的终点处形成。"},"keyTooltip":{"sourceKey":"Spell_OrnnQ_Tooltip","text":"奥恩猛砸地面，创造一道裂隙来造成<physicalDamage>@TotalDamage@物理伤害</physicalDamage>，以及持续@SlowDuration@秒的@SlowAmount@%<status>减速</status>。一根熔岩之柱会在裂隙的终点处形成，持续@PillarDuration@秒。 "},"keyTooltipExtendedBelowLine":{"sourceKey":"Spell_OrnnQ_TooltipExtendedBelowLine","text":"<rules>裂隙在命中一名敌方英雄后会短暂地停滞。</rules><br>"}},"spellCastTime":0.25,"mCastTime":0.30000001192092896,"values":[{"name":"BaseDamage","values":[-5,20,45,70,95,120,145],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"PillarDuration","values":[4,4,4,4,4,4,4],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"SlowAmount","values":[40,40,40,40,40,40,40],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"SlowDuration","values":[2,2,2,2,2,2,2],"__type":"SpellDataValue"}],"calculations":{"TotalDamage":{"mFormulaParts":[{"mDataValue":"BaseDamage","__type":"NamedDataValueCalculationPart"},{"mStat":2,"mCoefficient":1.100000023841858,"__type":"StatByCoefficientCalculationPart"}],"__type":"GameCalculation"}},"other":{"cooldownTime":[9,9,8.5,8,7.5,7,6.5],"Cooldown":{"values":[9,9,8.5,8,7.5,7,6.5],"__type":"{0a0eddc9}"},"mana":[45,45,45,45,45,45],"manaValues":{"values":[45,45,45,45,45,45],"{0a3e0478}":45,"__type":"{630af303}"}}}
{"skill":"ornn_w","text":{"keyName":{"sourceKey":"Spell_OrnnW_Name","text":"风箱炎息"},"keySummary":{"sourceKey":"Spell_OrnnW_Summary","text":"奥恩向前进发，喷出炎息。被最后一阵炎息命中的敌人将变为易碎状态。"},"keyTooltip":{"sourceKey":"Spell_OrnnW_Tooltip","text":"奥恩向前不可阻挡地重踏，同时喷吐炎息，在@BreathDuration@秒里持续造成共<magicDamage>@MaxPercentHPPerTickTooltip@%最大生命值的魔法伤害</magicDamage>。被最后一道炎息命中的敌人，会变成<keywordMajor>易碎</keywordMajor>效果，持续@BrittleDuration@秒。<br><br>对<keywordMajor>易碎</keywordMajor>状态的敌人施加的下一个<status>定身</status>效果将使该效果的持续时间提升30%并对目标造成额外的<magicDamage>@BrittlePercentMaxHPCalc@最大生命值的魔法伤害</magicDamage>。奥恩的普攻会<status>击退</status><keywordMajor>易碎</keywordMajor>状态下的目标，并造成额外伤害。"},"keyTooltipExtendedBelowLine":{"sourceKey":"Spell_OrnnW_TooltipExtendedBelowLine","text":"<rules>对英雄和小兵最少造成<magicDamage>@TotalMinimumDamage@魔法伤害</magicDamage>，对野怪最多造成<magicDamage>@TotalMonsterDamageCap@魔法伤害</magicDamage>。</rules>"}},"spellCastTime":0.25,"values":[{"name":"MinimumDamagePerTick","values":[6,16,26,36,46,56,66],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"NumberOfTicks","values":[5,5,5,5,5,5,5],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"BaseDamageTooltip","values":[50,100,150,200,250,300,350],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"BreathDuration","values":[0.75,0.75,0.75,0.75,0.75,0.75,0.75],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"RectangleWidth","values":[175,175,175,175,175,175,175],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"RectangleLength","values":[500,500,500,500,500,500,500],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"MovementSpeedReduction","values":[0.3499999940395355,0.3499999940395355,0.3499999940395355,0.3499999940395355,0.3499999940395355,0.3499999940395355,0.3499999940395355],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"FinalTickRectangleLength","values":[560,560,560,560,560,560,560],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"PercentHPPerTick","values":[0.02199999988079071,0.024000000208616257,0.026000000536441803,0.02800000086426735,0.029999999329447746,0.03200000151991844,0.03400000184774399],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"MaxPercentHPPerTickTooltip","va