{"skill":"shen_q","text":{"keyName":{"sourceKey":"Spell_ShenQ_Name","text":"奥义！暮临"},"keySummary":{"sourceKey":"Spell_ShenQ_Summary","text":"慎召回他的魂刃并用它进行攻击，造成基于目标最大生命值的额外伤害。如果魂刃在召回途中与一个敌方英雄产生了碰撞，那么慎的魂刃攻击会获得极大强化，并且所有被碰撞的敌人在逃离慎的时候都会被减速。"},"keyTooltip":{"sourceKey":"Spell_ShenQ_Tooltip","text":"慎召回他的<keywordMajor>魂刃</keywordMajor>。被其命中的敌人们在接下来的@SlowDuration@秒里，在远离慎的时候会被<status>减速</status>@SlowPercent@%。<br><br>此外，慎的下@NumEnhancedAttacks@次攻击造成额外的<magicDamage>@BaseFlatDamage@</magicDamage>外加<magicDamage>@BasePercentHealth@最大生命值的魔法伤害</magicDamage>。如果慎用<keywordMajor>魂刃</keywordMajor>命中了一名英雄，那么伤害提升至<magicDamage>@BaseFlatDamage@</magicDamage>外加<magicDamage>@EmpPercentHealth@最大生命值的魔法伤害</magicDamage>并且他的那几次攻击获得<attackSpeed>@SteroidAS@%攻击速度</attackSpeed>。"},"keyTooltipExtendedBelowLine":{"sourceKey":"Spell_ShenQ_TooltipExtendedBelowLine","text":"<rules>每次攻击对野怪造成@MonsterAmp*100@%伤害提升(最大值为<magicDamage>@MinionDamageCap@伤害</magicDamage>)。<br>对建筑物的攻击造成@TowerDamageCalc@伤害。</rules>"}},"values":[{"name":"QBaseOnHitDamage","values":[10,10,10,10,10,10,10],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"QPerLevelOnHitDamage","values":[6,6,6,6,6,6,6],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"QTowerDamageModifier","values":[1,1,1,1,1,1,1],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"QCollisionRadiusStart","values":[110,110,110,110,110,110,110],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"QCollisionRadiusEnd","values":[130,130,130,130,130,130,130],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"MonsterAmp","values":[1,1,1,1,1,1,1],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"BasePercentDamage","values":[1.5,2,2.5,3,3.5,4,4.5],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"NumEnhancedAttacks","values":[3,3,3,3,3,3,3],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"SlowPercent","values":[25,25,30,35,40,45,50],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"SlowDuration","values":[2,2,2,2,2,2,2],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"EnhancedPercentDamage","values":[4.5,5,5.5,6,6.5,7,7.5],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"MinionDamageCap","values":[75,100,125,150,175,200,225],"__type":"S